The {{Term/Store|Tunic of Twilight||Series, BotW, TotK}} is a recurring [[Item]] in {{TLoZ Series}}.{{Exp Game|BotW, TotK}}<ref name="BotW Inventory"/><ref name="TotK Inventory"/>

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Noncanon|Start}}
{{Descriptions BotW}}
The Tunic of Twilight is a piece of [[Armor]] which can be obtained using the [[Amiibo (Ability)|amiibo]] [[Rune]] while scanning the {{SSB|-}} Link amiibo '''or''' {{TP|-}} Link Amiibo. Each time the figure is scanned, a [[Treasure Chest]] will appear that has a small chance to contain the Tunic of Twilight. It can be enhanced by a [[Great Fairy]] but cannot be [[Dye]]d at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]].

The Tunic of Twilight, alongside the [[Cap of Twilight]] and [[Trousers of Twilight]], comprise the [[Hero of Twilight Set]] which resembles Link's outfit from {{TP}}. When it has been enhanced by two levels, it provides the Master Sword Beam Up [[Set Bonus]] when worn with the full set.

